{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"287","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. IQ Test"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the city of Ultima Thule job applicants are often offered an IQ test. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The test is as follows: the person gets a piece of squared paper with a "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4 × 4"},{"kind":"text","text":" square painted on it. Some of the square's cells are painted black and others are painted white. Your task is to repaint "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at most one"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" cell the other color so that the picture has a "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 × 2"},{"kind":"text","text":" square, completely consisting of cells of the same color. If the initial picture already has such a square, the person should just say so and the test will be completed. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to write a program that determines whether it is possible to pass the test. You cannot pass the test if either repainting any cell or no action doesn't result in a "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 × 2"},{"kind":"text","text":" square, consisting of cells of the same color."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Four lines contain four characters each: the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th character of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line equals \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if the cell in the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th row and the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th column of the square is painted white, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"#"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", if the cell is black."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without the quotes), if the test can be passed and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without the quotes) otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"####\n.#..\n####\n....\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"YES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"####\n....\n####\n....\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"NO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test sample it is enough to repaint the first cell in the second row. After such repainting the required "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 × 2"},{"kind":"text","text":" square is on the intersection of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":"-st and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":"-nd row with the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":"-st and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":"-nd column."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"287A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/287/problem/A"}